msgstr "Not supplied"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_personal_id_desc"
msgid "Israeli ID of the cardholder, checked for a valid check digit before the capture is sent. The payment page does not always ask for one, and a Direct (debit) card is charged only when the ID matches the account it is drawn on. Anything that is not a real ID goes out as 000000000, which tells the issuer none was supplied."
msgstr "Israeli ID of the cardholder, checked for a valid check digit before the capture is sent. The payment page does not always ask for one, and a Direct (debit) card is charged only when the ID matches the account it is drawn on. Anything that is not a real ID goes out as 000000000, which tells the issuer none was supplied."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_personal_id_refused"
msgid "The capture was refused over the ID or the CVV. A token charge carries no CVV, so fill in the cardholder's Israeli ID here and capture again."
msgstr "The capture was refused over the ID or the CVV. A token charge carries no CVV, so fill in the cardholder's Israeli ID here and capture again."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_warning_bad_personal_id"
msgid "That is not a valid Israeli ID: nine digits, left-padded with zeros, the last of them a check digit computed from the other eight. The capture was sent without an ID."
msgstr "That is not a valid Israeli ID: nine digits, left-padded with zeros, the last of them a check digit computed from the other eight. The capture was sent without an ID."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_error_payments_range"
msgid "The number of payments must be between 1 and [max]."
msgstr "The number of payments must be between 1 and [max]."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_error_missing_auth_data"
msgid "The authorization is missing data required for the capture ([fields]). Check that MoreData=True is sent with the payment request."
msgstr "The authorization is missing data required for the capture ([fields]). Check that MoreData=True is sent with the payment request."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_pi_voided_on"
msgid "[amount] hold released on [date]"
msgstr "[amount] hold released on [date]"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_warning_no_uid"
msgid "Hyp did not return UID with the authorization, so this hold cannot be captured. This almost always means the return URL was cut short: Hyp echoes Info, ClientName, street and city back unencoded, and a \"#\" in any of them turns the rest of the URL into a fragment the browser never sends. Enable debug mode and look at query_string in hypay_ezcount.log to see where it stopped."
msgstr "Hyp did not return UID with the authorization, so this hold cannot be captured. This almost always means the return URL was cut short: Hyp echoes Info, ClientName, street and city back unencoded, and a \"#\" in any of them turns the rest of the URL into a fragment the browser never sends. Enable debug mode and look at query_string in hypay_ezcount.log to see where it stopped."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_pi_voided_confirmed"
msgid "J5 hold cancelled on Hyp — not charged"
msgstr "J5 hold cancelled on Hyp — not charged"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_note_voided_confirmed"
msgid "Hypay J5: cancelled via CancelTrans, Hyp confirmed the funds were released"
msgstr "Hypay J5: cancelled via CancelTrans, Hyp confirmed the funds were released"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_note_voided_unconfirmed"
msgid "Hypay J5: hold marked cancelled locally, Hyp did not confirm it ([detail]). The issuer releases the funds when the authorization window expires."
msgstr "Hypay J5: hold marked cancelled locally, Hyp did not confirm it ([detail]). The issuer releases the funds when the authorization window expires."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_void_ok_confirmed"
msgid "Hyp confirmed the hold was cancelled — the funds were released immediately."
msgstr "Hyp confirmed the hold was cancelled — the funds were released immediately."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_void_ok_unconfirmed"
msgid "The hold was cancelled locally, but Hyp could not confirm the cancellation (it may already be near its authorization window). The issuer releases the funds within about [days] days."
msgstr "The hold was cancelled locally, but Hyp could not confirm the cancellation (it may already be near its authorization window). The issuer releases the funds within about [days] days."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_void_not_confirmed_hint"
msgid "Hyp did not confirm this cancellation through CancelTrans (shown below). The hold is treated as abandoned on our side either way and will never be captured; the issuer releases the funds when the authorization window expires."
msgstr "Hyp did not confirm this cancellation through CancelTrans (shown below). The hold is treated as abandoned on our side either way and will never be captured; the issuer releases the funds when the authorization window expires."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_working"
msgid "Contacting Hyp, please wait…"
msgstr "Contacting Hyp, please wait…"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_uid"
msgid "Shva UID"
msgstr "Shva UID"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_void_ok_not_cancellable"
msgid "The hold will not be captured. Hyp refused to reverse it, so the issuer releases the funds when the authorization window ends, within about [days] days."
msgstr "The hold will not be captured. Hyp refused to reverse it, so the issuer releases the funds when the authorization window ends, within about [days] days."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_note_voided_not_cancellable"
msgid "Hypay J5: hold cancelled here, Hyp refused to reverse it on its side; the issuer releases the funds when the authorization window ends."
msgstr "Hypay J5: hold cancelled here, Hyp refused to reverse it on its side; the issuer releases the funds when the authorization window ends."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_void_not_cancellable_hint"
msgid "Hyp refused to reverse this hold — its answer is below. Nothing was charged and the hold can never be captured; the issuer releases the funds when the authorization window ends, within about [days] days."
msgstr "Hyp refused to reverse this hold — its answer is below. Nothing was charged and the hold can never be captured; the issuer releases the funds when the authorization window ends, within about [days] days."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_void_ok_instalments"
msgid "The hold will not be captured. Hyp does not reverse a hold taken in instalments, so the issuer releases the funds when the authorization window ends, within about [days] days."
msgstr "The hold will not be captured. Hyp does not reverse a hold taken in instalments, so the issuer releases the funds when the authorization window ends, within about [days] days."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_note_voided_instalments"
msgid "Hypay J5: hold cancelled here. Hyp does not reverse a hold taken in instalments, so the issuer releases the funds when the authorization window ends."
msgstr "Hypay J5: hold cancelled here. Hyp does not reverse a hold taken in instalments, so the issuer releases the funds when the authorization window ends."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_void_instalments_hint"
msgid "This hold was taken in instalments, and Hyp does not reverse those through CancelTrans - a single-payment hold is released immediately, an instalment one is refused whatever payment details the request carries. Nothing was charged and the hold can never be captured; the issuer releases the funds when the authorization window ends, within about [days] days."
msgstr "This hold was taken in instalments, and Hyp does not reverse those through CancelTrans - a single-payment hold is released immediately, an instalment one is refused whatever payment details the request carries. Nothing was charged and the hold can never be captured; the issuer releases the funds when the authorization window ends, within about [days] days."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_void_instalments_notice_short"
msgid "An instalment hold is not released early."
msgstr "An instalment hold is not released early."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_void_instalments_notice"
msgid "Cancelling: this hold was taken in more than one payment, and Hyp does not release those early — cancelling still guarantees it is never captured, but the funds stay held until the authorization window ends, within about [days] days. A single-payment hold is released immediately."
msgstr "Cancelling: this hold was taken in more than one payment, and Hyp does not release those early — cancelling still guarantees it is never captured, but the funds stay held until the authorization window ends, within about [days] days. A single-payment hold is released immediately."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_hide_btns"
msgid "hideBtns for J5"
msgstr "hideBtns for J5"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_hide_btns_inherit"
msgid "Same as a regular charge"
msgstr "Same as a regular charge"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_hide_btns_on"
msgid "On — hide the buttons"
msgstr "On — hide the buttons"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_hide_btns_off"
msgid "Off — show the buttons"
msgstr "Off — show the buttons"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_hide_btns_desc"
msgid "Overrides the hideBtns checkbox above for J5 authorizations only, so a hold can show different buttons on the payment page than a charge. Leave it on \"Same as a regular charge\" to keep using the checkbox."
msgstr "Overrides the hideBtns checkbox above for J5 authorizations only, so a hold can show different buttons on the payment page than a charge. Leave it on \"Same as a regular charge\" to keep using the checkbox."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_ua_uuid_j5"
msgid "UA UUID for J5 documents"
msgstr "UA UUID for J5 documents"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_ua_uuid_j5_desc"
msgid "Used for the document issued after a J5 capture, instead of the UA UUID above. This field does not fall back to it: leave it empty and J5 documents are created without ua_uuid at all, even when the field above is filled in."
msgstr "Used for the document issued after a J5 capture, instead of the UA UUID above. This field does not fall back to it: leave it empty and J5 documents are created without ua_uuid at all, even when the field above is filled in."



msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_capture_fallback_also_refused"
msgid "the ordinary charge that followed was refused too:"
msgstr "the ordinary charge that followed was refused too:"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_captured_by_fallback"
msgid "The capture was refused, so the amount was charged as a separate transaction on the saved card."
msgstr "The capture was refused, so the amount was charged as a separate transaction on the saved card."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_fallback_hold_released"
msgid "The hold was reversed with it, and drops off the card straight away."
msgstr "The hold was reversed with it, and drops off the card straight away."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_fallback_hold_stays"
msgid "The hold could not be reversed - it is only cancellable on the day it was taken. It is never captured now, and the issuer releases it within [days] days."
msgstr "The hold could not be reversed - it is only cancellable on the day it was taken. It is never captured now, and the issuer releases it within [days] days."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_note_fallback_released"
msgid "The capture was refused by the acquirer; the amount was charged as a separate transaction and the hold was reversed."
msgstr "The capture was refused by the acquirer; the amount was charged as a separate transaction and the hold was reversed."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_note_fallback_hold_stays"
msgid "The capture was refused by the acquirer; the amount was charged as a separate transaction. The hold could not be reversed and is released by the issuer within [days] days."
msgstr "The capture was refused by the acquirer; the amount was charged as a separate transaction. The hold could not be reversed and is released by the issuer within [days] days."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_capture_fallback"
msgid "Refused capture"
msgstr "Refused capture"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_capture_fallback_label"
msgid "Charge the saved card when the capture is refused"
msgstr "Charge the saved card when the capture is refused"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_capture_fallback_desc"
msgid "An immediate-debit (Direct) card refuses a capture that carries the hold's authorization number (CCode 512, 455, 445). With this on, the amount is then charged as an ordinary transaction on the saved card, and the hold is reversed if it still can be - so the order is paid instead of stuck. Switch it off to have the refusal reported and nothing charged."
msgstr "An immediate-debit (Direct) card refuses a capture that carries the hold's authorization number (CCode 512, 455, 445). With this on, the amount is then charged as an ordinary transaction on the saved card, and the hold is reversed if it still can be - so the order is paid instead of stuck. Switch it off to have the refusal reported and nothing charged."


msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_personal_id_desc_short"
msgid "Sent with the capture, checked before it goes out."
msgstr "Sent with the capture, checked before it goes out."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_personal_id_bad"
msgid "Not a valid Israeli ID — the check digit does not match. Capture as it stands and 000000000 is sent instead."
msgstr "Not a valid Israeli ID — the check digit does not match. Capture as it stands and 000000000 is sent instead."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_immediate_amount_locked"
msgid "This is an immediate-debit card, so the charge is pinned to the amount the customer approved and the order total cannot be changed before capturing."
msgstr "This is an immediate-debit card, so the charge is pinned to the amount the customer approved and the order total cannot be changed before capturing."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_immediate_amount_locked_blocked"
msgid "The order total no longer matches the hold, and on an immediate-debit card it must: the charge is a fresh sale on the saved card rather than a capture, so it can only be made for the amount the customer approved. Restore the order total to capture."
msgstr "The order total no longer matches the hold, and on an immediate-debit card it must: the charge is a fresh sale on the saved card rather than a capture, so it can only be made for the amount the customer approved. Restore the order total to capture."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_j5_error_immediate_amount_locked"
msgid "This is an immediate-debit card: the charge can only be made for the amount the customer approved, [amount]. Restore the order total and capture again."
msgstr "This is an immediate-debit card: the charge can only be made for the amount the customer approved, [amount]. Restore the order total and capture again."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_card"
msgid "Card"
msgstr "Card"


msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_customer_name"
msgid "EzCount name"
msgstr "EzCount name"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_customer_name_label"
msgid "Use the customer's EzCount name instead of the profile name"
msgstr "Use the customer's EzCount name instead of the profile name"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_customer_name_desc"
msgid "Names the document after the customer's EzCount name - the profile \"Fax\" field, the same one the EzCount Invoice Generator add-on reads. A customer who never filled it in is still named on the document, by their profile name."
msgstr "Names the document after the customer's EzCount name - the profile \"Fax\" field, the same one the EzCount Invoice Generator add-on reads. A customer who never filled it in is still named on the document, by their profile name."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_customer_vat"
msgid "VAT ID"
msgstr "VAT ID"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_customer_vat_label"
msgid "Send the customer's VAT ID"
msgstr "Send the customer's VAT ID"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_customer_vat_desc"
msgid "Sends the VAT ID from the profile \"URL\" field as customer_crn, so the document is made out to the company rather than to a private buyer."
msgstr "Sends the VAT ID from the profile \"URL\" field as customer_crn, so the document is made out to the company rather than to a private buyer."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_int_customer_vat_desc"
msgid "Sends the VAT ID from the profile \"URL\" field to Hyp as UserId, which is the number the document it issues is filed under. It is never sent with a J5 authorization: UserId there is the cardholder ID Shva checks the later capture against, and a company number is not that."
msgstr "Sends the VAT ID from the profile \"URL\" field to Hyp as UserId, which is the number the document it issues is filed under. It is never sent with a J5 authorization: UserId there is the cardholder ID Shva checks the later capture against, and a company number is not that."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_int_customer_limits"
msgid "Only these two travel with a payment request. The EzCount CC e-mail and filing the document under an existing customer card are set on the document itself, which Hyp - not this add-on - issues in integrated mode; the direct API settings below cover both."
msgstr "Only these two travel with a payment request. The EzCount CC e-mail and filing the document under an existing customer card are set on the document itself, which Hyp - not this add-on - issues in integrated mode; the direct API settings below cover both."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_customer_assoc"
msgid "Customer card"
msgstr "Customer card"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_customer_assoc_label"
msgid "File the document under the customer's EzCount card"
msgstr "File the document under the customer's EzCount card"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_customer_assoc_desc"
msgid "Sends customerAction=ASSOC_ONLY, so EzCount attaches the document to a customer card that already matches and does not create a new one. This is what the EzCount Invoice Generator add-on does."
msgstr "Sends customerAction=ASSOC_ONLY, so EzCount attaches the document to a customer card that already matches and does not create a new one. This is what the EzCount Invoice Generator add-on does."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_customer_cc_emails"
msgid "CC e-mail"
msgstr "CC e-mail"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_customer_cc_emails_label"
msgid "Send the customer's EzCount CC e-mail"
msgstr "Send the customer's EzCount CC e-mail"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_customer_cc_emails_desc"
msgid "Copies the document to the addresses in the customer's EzCount CC e-mail profile field. Several addresses may be separated by commas."
msgstr "Copies the document to the addresses in the customer's EzCount CC e-mail profile field. Several addresses may be separated by commas."

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_cc_email_field_id"
msgid "CC e-mail profile field ID"
msgstr "CC e-mail profile field ID"

msgctxt "Languages::hypay_ez_cc_email_field_id_desc"
msgid "The ID of the profile field holding the EzCount CC e-mail. Leave it empty to use the field named ezcount_additional_email, which is the one the EzCount Invoice Generator add-on reads."
msgstr "The ID of the profile field holding the EzCount CC e-mail. Leave it empty to use the field named ezcount_additional_email, which is the one the EzCount Invoice Generator add-on reads."
